# "Cast this spell only before the combat damage step" (Berserk, CR 601.3) binds a cast made as another spell's cascade
# trigger resolves, as it binds any cast (CR 101.2: "can't" beats "can"). Bot1 casts Bloodbraid Challenger in the second main
# phase of turn 3; its cascade (CR 702.85a) exiles Berserk, mana value 1, which may not be cast then: no offer is made
# (`! Bot1.Accept`) and the card goes to the bottom of the library. The first-main-phase cast in "cascade casts berserk before
# combat damage" is the positive control.

